th a serene yet sharp immortal-like appearance.\n<Subject 2> is the young female warrior in <Picture 2>, with dark hair styled in an elaborate updo adorned with gold and ruby hair ornaments, wearing a rich crimson and gold embroidered gown with a decorative black-gold belt and red heeled boots, with a fierce and regal bearing.\n<Subject 3> is the ancient ruined stone tower environment in <Picture 3>, featuring a weathered grey stone tower with an arched entrance flanked by two glowing orange windows, twisted bare trees, broken stone steps, overgrown grass, thick fog, and god rays piercing through a pale overcast sky.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video depicts an intense 10-second martial-arts duel between <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> inside <Subject 3>, the ruined stone tower courtyard. The fight features explosive magical effects, wide sweeping combat movements, traditional Chinese kung-fu techniques, and dynamic camera work including rapid tracking shots, low-angle spins, and impact-driven whip pans.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the white-robed male cultivator's silver crown, black high ponytail, white and pale-blue embroidered robe, silver belt, and immortal appearance are retained throughout.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the red-robed female warrior's gold-ruby hair ornaments, crimson and gold gown, black-gold belt, red boots, and fierce regal bearing are retained throughout.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the ruined stone tower, arched entrance with glowing orange windows, twisted bare trees, broken stone steps, fog, and god rays are retained as the combat environment.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a cinematic 4K wuxia fantasy fight sequence at 60fps, with high contrast, desaturated cool tones punctuated by warm orange glow from the tower windows and brilliant magical energy effects.\n[Shot 1] A wide low-angle establishing shot slowly cranes up from the broken stone steps of <Subject 3>, revealing the ruined tower with its glowing arched entrance and swirling fog. <Subject 1>, the white-robed male cultivator, stands on the left in a calm defensive stance with one hand raised, pale-blue spiritual energy gathering around his fingertips. <Subject 2>, the crimson-robed female warrior, stands on the right in a wide aggressive stance, her right arm extended as red-gold flame energy curls around her forearm. Wind whips both robes and hair. The camera holds for a beat then rapidly pushes in toward the space between them.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the shot cuts to a dynamic tracking shot following <Subject 2> as she launches forward in a flying side kick, trailing a plume of red-gold flame. <Subject 1> sidesteps and counters with a flowing palm strike that releases a crescent of pale-blue energy. The two energies collide mid-air with a blinding shockwave that sends debris and fog outward. The camera orbits 180 degrees around the impact at high speed, motion-blurring the background tower.\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, the shot cuts to a ground-level shot looking up as <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> exchange a rapid flurry of close-quarters kung-fu strikes — punches, elbow strikes, and spinning kicks — their movements wide and powerful, each blow sparking colliding bursts of blue and red energy. The camera performs a fast continuous roll around the fighters, whipping between low angles and Dutch tilts, emphasizing the scale and ferocity. <Subject 2> leaps and delivers a downward axe kick that cracks the stone floor; <Subject 1> blocks with a crossed-arm energy barrier that flares bright white.\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.800, the shot cuts to a slow-motion medium shot as both fighters leap backward simultaneously, then charge toward each other for a final climactic clash. <Subject 1> gathers a massive orb of swirling blue-white energy in both palms; <Subject 2> conjures a blazing red-gold energy spear. They collide at center frame in a cataclysmic explosion of light, the shockwave rippling outward, shattering nearby stone and scattering the fog. The camera shakes violently then holds on the expanding energy blast as the video ends at 10 seconds.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nDeep wind howling through the ruined tower, the crackle and whoosh of magical energy, heavy impact thuds on stone, debris clattering, and the sharp swish of robes and limbs during rapid combat movements.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA powerful orchestral wuxia score with pounding taiko drums, soaring erhu, and aggressive string ostinatos, building steadily from a tense opening to a thunderous climax at the final energy collision.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [1980, 680], "pos": [-4880, 5370], "id": 172, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 16}, {"showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [276], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [277], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#346434", "widgets_values": ["9:16 (Portrait Widescreen)", 1, 32], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "preview", "label": "preview", "type": "RESOLUTION_PREVIEW", "localized_name": "preview"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "loca